]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71804/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ae9e8a3d-8cfb-594b-8891-1ea6b2009fbb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71804/selection/8c9114fde4c99835d667118848c4be48e2d8a90a4642baa05ea9032af5a61a67" :answer-field/choices ["q-71804/selection/bb145282e6d2cd1140bb4a29c0020108eba525ae436bb7f7737b9a4598df043b" "q-71804/selection/341839d0c756d62724cc5ae5675bd3cb3b84cb1884707b8850fd285993ac83c8" "q-71804/selection/c2dbe87578b4c50c2e8f1a26f7964e2f41e01e6798780f3f6e2e030a2d3f0998" "q-71804/selection/8c9114fde4c99835d667118848c4be48e2d8a90a4642baa05ea9032af5a61a67" "q-71804/selection/cb1db0573affadceb7ddef581e0067e8edcc52e773f4a887bf7e8756c4f30c15"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71804" :question/id #uuid "435e7026-e394-50fd-9cc2-55c6f6298c7e" :question/math-academy-id "q-71804" :question/problem "Represent the following system of equations using matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2x+5y=-1 \\\\ 5x=15\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's write the system so that both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation. \nThe variable $y$ does not appear in the second equation, but this just means its coefficient is $0.$ So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-2x+5y=-1 \\\\ 5x+0y=15\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 15\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71804/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ce2e21aa-f89d-5d10-b815-c66a2b46ef5c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71804"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "a6fb7b69-5f5f-5a90-929c-86fe93404cdc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "857eb249-ad8b-5167-a8b1-b35d4c144ad8" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275612/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-275612/field-1/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-2/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer/id #uuid "24c94a36-e484-5ceb-9995-66292cc8fe0b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "dd57cfe2-d61b-51e7-973b-d2efc23c5d25" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275612/field-2/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473" :answer-field/choices ["q-275612/field-2/ae9425c9e204310ed598f729a242e0b42a2acbbf125bff30bc2080e10b8cf473"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d84d7eb9-aa25-54fe-9c40-b230a780c2cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "4c4cd0cb-e99c-5756-9de3-12a67f415b56" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275612/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-275612/field-3/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-4/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer/id #uuid "158e6771-9e67-5283-bccb-51803c54845d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "af264061-7716-56ee-ac3c-18bb07f83d0b" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275612/field-4/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff" :answer-field/choices ["q-275612/field-4/b13ac151352392d38026eed875b911708c50c896d6c09463410ac041030163ff"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275612" :question/id #uuid "f8a84340-963d-5015-a9d9-2f93ab0b6c20" :question/math-academy-id "q-275612" :question/problem "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-4y+3x=8 \\\\ 2x=-3,\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $2$ | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | $8$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | {{field-2}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $2$ | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $8$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and  both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}3x-4y=8 \\\\ 2x+0y=-3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275612/field-1" "q-275612/field-2" "q-275612/field-3" "q-275612/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f4f746a1-ea9e-5136-90d6-d4dee1306c17"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275612"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317530/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "d4414b12-cf25-570e-a14b-91929451f83b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186285637 :answer-field/choices ["q-317530/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12291/selection/d1b9410d5410ca6fcdb622efa17252678791861cefce021afad706d05330f91b" :answer/id #uuid "2ab79c24-cea4-5450-936c-c5a0abfe4945" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12291/selection/8503402387ea26f29735c87d93d7c587a7671a37c1449ab76dad093a33c8bf3b" :answer/id #uuid "209a7be1-d08b-57f4-a565-edb3f452c8d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12291/selection/796f00f31c3314381b2da19e6266e70788ee5314f99a5ddd98f55817f0236e77" :answer/id #uuid "65ab39fb-8796-53b1-918f-21ff6d859495" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}