\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-y=-1 \\\\ x+y=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-12291/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f4f746a1-ea9e-5136-90d6-d4dee1306c17"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12291"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "617b0a48-dace-5e01-ba95-68a70ddb0009" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "809b4ede-4f3f-5d6f-8518-28db8dd342f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "c5f552f1-a861-5f61-808b-08f551948fd7" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317536/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer-field/choices ["q-317536/field-1/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-317536/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "3cf9b64f-169d-5647-af00-eecc0a224162" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "37cee8be-318d-5624-944c-246ae2784a04" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317536/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-317536/field-2/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-3/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "e9f26fc2-f2ad-50a4-aeec-23bb88f70f02" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "833679f9-1686-5e66-8604-8bf067adbdfb" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317536/field-3/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer-field/choices ["q-317536/field-3/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "2f2bd679-e275-5b24-b16d-cbab318d9c6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "206dfbcf-6ebc-5c98-8294-ab011b693e57" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317536/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-317536/field-4/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317536" :question/id #uuid "6647a017-0288-57ca-9985-46b13f20dac5" :question/math-academy-id "q-317536" :question/problem "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4y-x=3 \\\\ 9y+2x=5,\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | {{field-1}} | $4$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $5$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | $4$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $5$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+4y=3 \\\\ 2x+9y=5\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317536/field-1" "q-317536/field-2" "q-317536/field-3" "q-317536/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f4f746a1-ea9e-5136-90d6-d4dee1306c17"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317536"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317540/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "d0d1cb97-6c3b-5b01-a60c-e61207979561" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317540/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0bfd3682-72a2-5cb3-bfe6-9aad82f358c6" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.